=== prompt
From the sequence [1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8], keep only the even numbers and log the resulting sequence (as one value).
=== expected
[2 4 6 8]
=== reference
[1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8] = xs
[] | Var(out)
0 | Var(i)
Repeat({
  xs | Take(i) = x
  When({x | Math.Divide(2) | Math.Multiply(2) | Is(x)} {x | Push(out)})
  Inc(i)
} times: 8)
out | Log
